WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.110
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.380 --> 00:07.100
[The content, events, techniques, and outcomes of massage depicted in this series]

3
00:07.210 --> 00:08.211
[are entirely fictional and intended for entertainment purposes only.]

4
00:08.240 --> 00:09.421
[They should not be used as medical advice or as a reference for traditional Thai massage.]

5
00:09.500 --> 00:10.901
[Viewer discretion is advised. Do not attempt to imitate any of the techniques shown,]

6
00:11.000 --> 00:12.001
[as doing so may result in injury.]

7
00:12.030 --> 00:13.161
[Massage services should only be provided by practitioners]

8
00:13.170 --> 00:14.800
[who are legally licensed and registered.]

9
00:14.900 --> 00:18.080
If we trigger the smoke detectors,

10
00:18.230 --> 00:19.920
the alarm will go off.

11
00:19.950 --> 00:22.000
Everyone will panic, including the people in the gambling den.

12
00:22.288 --> 00:24.600
Anyone carrying chips, cash, or guns will be exposed.

13
00:25.430 --> 00:27.040
The smoke detector has been triggered, Master Tim.

14
00:27.195 --> 00:28.296
But we haven't found the source yet.

15
00:30.280 --> 00:32.650
Everyone, are you seeing what I'm seeing?

16
00:32.808 --> 00:33.840
Inn, we're safe now.

17
00:34.571 --> 00:35.572
The police are here.

18
00:35.600 --> 00:36.601
Drop your weapons!

19
00:36.640 --> 00:37.841
You're nothing but thugs in uniform!

20
00:39.593 --> 00:40.760
So, you think you're good at massage, huh?

21
00:40.810 --> 00:41.811
No!

22
00:42.320 --> 00:43.321
That's enough!

23
00:43.700 --> 00:46.170
I told you not to touch Korn or his daughter yet!

24
00:46.254 --> 00:49.640
What's with your obsession with that ridiculous deadly massage technique?

25
00:49.758 --> 00:51.880
I think it's time to end this, massage therapist.

26
00:57.083 --> 00:58.084
Dad!

27
00:58.208 --> 00:59.560
Hand over the manual already!

28
00:59.600 --> 01:03.720
- Here, take it! - You have to let everyone go.

29
01:03.770 --> 01:06.071
You're in no position to bargain with me!

30
01:07.429 --> 01:08.520
Without me,

31
01:10.043 --> 01:12.800
this fucking manual is worthless.

32
01:13.100 --> 01:15.880
- What's it going to be, Tim? - Dad!

33
02:18.742 --> 02:19.743
Minkheng!

34
02:20.096 --> 02:22.000
Find something to splint her fingers. Keep them from moving.

35
02:22.440 --> 02:23.441
Okay.

36
02:25.632 --> 02:27.440
- Will this do? - Okay, okay.

37
02:28.886 --> 02:29.807
Good.

38
02:29.847 --> 02:32.760
Support her hands. Don't let the blood rush to her fingertips.

39
02:33.216 --> 02:34.217
Slowly.

40
02:35.190 --> 02:36.840
Bring her other hand over. Slowly.

41
02:37.974 --> 02:38.975
How is it?

42
02:40.160 --> 02:41.161
Hold it steady.

43
02:45.206 --> 02:46.207
Okay.

44
02:46.406 --> 02:47.407
All done.

45
02:48.288 --> 02:49.500
- Keep supporting her hands. - Hattha!

46
02:55.214 --> 02:56.215
The leading pressure point.

47
03:02.886 --> 03:03.887
The surrounding pressure points.

48
03:07.611 --> 03:09.400
Let me go! It hurts!

49
03:09.494 --> 03:12.120
Why are you still in pain if I followed the manual?

50
03:13.590 --> 03:15.320
Are you really in pain, or are you faking it?

51
03:15.616 --> 03:17.840
Of course it hurts, damn it! Let me go!

52
03:18.675 --> 03:19.676
It hurts!

53
03:22.206 --> 03:23.207
The death point.

54
03:37.459 --> 03:39.080
What kind of bullshit manual is this?

55
03:39.896 --> 03:42.080
The deadly massage technique I want isn't supposed to hurt!

56
03:42.286 --> 03:43.287
The victim shouldn't even know what's happening!

57
03:44.894 --> 03:46.880
There's something you're still hiding from me, isn't there? Huh?

58
03:47.406 --> 03:48.592
You're still keeping something from me, aren't you?

59
03:49.198 --> 03:51.320
What does the manual say?

60
03:53.331 --> 03:54.360
Exactly what it says there.

61
03:55.038 --> 03:57.240
You think you can keep it from me?

62
04:06.176 --> 04:08.800
You should never have survived this long!

63
04:08.832 --> 04:11.520
You should've fucking died 15 years ago!

64
04:11.728 --> 04:15.440
You should never have made it this far!

65
04:44.700 --> 04:45.701
The leading pressure point.

66
04:48.566 --> 04:49.567
The surrounding pressure points.

67
04:51.995 --> 04:53.044
The danger point.

68
04:55.800 --> 04:57.520
The secret is...

69
05:13.174 --> 05:14.175
to knead.

70
05:22.000 --> 05:24.206
Hurry! We need to set the bone back in place!

71
05:24.798 --> 05:25.880
Come on, help me!

72
05:26.558 --> 05:28.400
Phat, weren't you shot too?

73
05:28.904 --> 05:31.432
Yes, but I'm fine. Take care of Hattha first.

74
05:37.942 --> 05:38.943
Easy now.

75
05:39.880 --> 05:40.881
Let me take a look.

76
05:48.462 --> 05:49.463
Dad!

77
05:49.680 --> 05:50.681
- Hattha! - Dad!

78
05:51.811 --> 05:55.280
Come here and help. Wait, Hattha.

79
05:55.398 --> 05:56.560
- Listen to me. - Stay still.

80
05:56.700 --> 05:57.701
We'll worry about your dad later.

81
05:58.374 --> 05:59.480
Right now, we need to treat your fingers.

82
06:01.398 --> 06:04.000
- Stay still. Keep breathing. - She must be in so much pain.

83
06:04.552 --> 06:05.710
- Easy now. - Minkheng!

84
06:05.886 --> 06:08.120
- Go check on Muk. If anything happens, come get us. - Stay still.

85
06:10.990 --> 06:12.760
- Hold her down. Hold Hattha still. - Calm down. Stay still.

86
06:13.806 --> 06:14.807
I've got it, Dad.

87
06:16.176 --> 06:17.445
Quick, help me hold her still.

88
06:20.352 --> 06:21.353
Take a deep breath.

89
06:29.400 --> 06:30.401
Stay still. Don't move.

90
06:32.126 --> 06:33.127
Ready?

91
06:34.100 --> 06:35.101
One.

92
06:35.878 --> 06:36.879
Two.

93
06:37.046 --> 06:38.047
Three!

94
06:39.700 --> 06:41.000
Breathe. Keep breathing.

95
06:41.072 --> 06:42.480
- Easy now. - Can you manage, sweetheart?

96
06:43.360 --> 06:44.422
Yes, I can. I'm okay.

97
06:47.440 --> 06:49.160
Stay still. Take a deep breath.

98
06:49.496 --> 06:50.497
Take a deep breath.

99
06:51.100 --> 06:52.101
Stay still, Hattha.

100
06:58.768 --> 07:01.100
- All done! It's over now. - Keep breathing.

101
07:01.170 --> 07:02.171
Help me bandage her wounds.

102
07:19.771 --> 07:21.800
Uncle Inn, please hurry and check on Muk!

103
07:26.838 --> 07:27.839
Muk!

104
07:29.270 --> 07:30.271
Muk!

105
07:33.627 --> 07:35.000
Let me see where you were hit.

106
07:49.104 --> 07:50.105
The first spot.

107
07:50.843 --> 07:51.844
The second.

108
07:52.582 --> 07:53.583
The third.

109
07:54.600 --> 07:55.601
The fourth.

110
07:57.206 --> 07:58.207
The fifth.

111
07:59.632 --> 08:01.040
Then I'll take Muk to the hospital, Dad.

112
08:01.312 --> 08:02.313
No.

113
08:03.019 --> 08:04.480
We shouldn't move Muk ourselves.

114
08:05.678 --> 08:06.840
I'll go call an ambulance.

115
08:20.256 --> 08:21.700
I thought you said you were okay.

116
08:29.904 --> 08:30.905
Don't talk anymore.

117
09:13.278 --> 09:14.279
Email.

118
09:14.451 --> 09:15.452
Password.

119
09:16.056 --> 09:17.057
Phone passcode.

120
09:18.627 --> 09:19.628
What's all this, Muk?

121
09:21.550 --> 09:22.800
Everything Master Tim does,

122
09:23.912 --> 09:25.920
everyone he contacts,

123
09:27.294 --> 09:29.640
goes through me.

124
09:32.790 --> 09:35.720
All the evidence...

125
09:36.790 --> 09:38.100
is in here.

126
09:41.419 --> 09:45.880
Make sure he ends up in prison.

127
09:48.899 --> 09:52.774
Don't let Master Tim...

128
09:53.072 --> 09:54.700
do this...

129
09:55.307 --> 09:57.440
to anyone else.

130
09:59.390 --> 10:00.391
Don't worry.

131
10:01.720 --> 10:03.715
Master Tim will pay for what he's done to you.

132
10:07.534 --> 10:09.300
And you have to be there to see it for yourself.

133
10:22.048 --> 10:23.360
This is a new scented oil.

134
10:24.496 --> 10:25.497
I made it for you.

135
10:33.912 --> 10:35.100
It smells lovely.

136
10:38.803 --> 10:40.304
Mysterious, just like you.

137
10:48.062 --> 10:51.160
Thank you.

138
11:29.120 --> 11:30.160
I'm sorry.

139
11:31.100 --> 11:32.640
I should've taken better care of you.

140
11:39.000 --> 11:41.400
Don't apologize.

141
11:43.814 --> 11:48.280
You did everything you could.

142
11:50.950 --> 11:53.400
Thank you...

143
11:54.630 --> 11:57.320
for showing me...

144
11:59.140 --> 12:00.760
what it feels like...

145
12:01.570 --> 12:03.000
to have a family.

146
12:17.990 --> 12:18.991
Muk!

147
12:19.488 --> 12:20.489
Muk!

148
12:22.176 --> 12:23.400
Muk, wait! Muk!

149
12:24.280 --> 12:25.681
Muk... Wait, Muk!

150
12:25.971 --> 12:27.322
Muk! Muk!

151
12:29.072 --> 12:30.073
Muk!

152
12:30.400 --> 12:32.601
- Over here! - The ambulance is here!

153
12:32.686 --> 12:34.300
- The ambulance is here! - Muk!

154
12:36.022 --> 12:37.623
- Excuse us, please. - Please let us through.

155
13:15.531 --> 13:16.532
Relax.

156
13:22.918 --> 13:23.919
The leading pressure point.

157
13:36.720 --> 13:37.721
The surrounding pressure points.

158
13:55.051 --> 13:56.052
Just let it go, Tim.

159
14:01.627 --> 14:02.628
The death point.

160
14:44.723 --> 14:46.100
I did it, Korn!

161
14:48.536 --> 14:50.160
I can kill with massage now! See that?

162
15:02.118 --> 15:04.400
I can kill anyone I want now, Korn!

163
15:05.915 --> 15:09.360
No pain. No awareness.

164
15:11.323 --> 15:13.100
No one can ever catch me.

165
15:23.083 --> 15:24.700
This is truly shocking news.

166
15:24.720 --> 15:27.880
Last night, an unidentified man's charred body was found

167
15:27.900 --> 15:29.700
inside a burning car.

168
15:29.730 --> 15:33.720
He was later identified as Police Colonel Krit Teeranasakul,

169
15:33.942 --> 15:37.440
a prominent former police officer who resigned to enter politics.

170
15:37.680 --> 15:39.800
So far, no one has come forward

171
15:39.881 --> 15:44.000
to give a clear statement regarding his death.

172
15:44.048 --> 15:45.920
This has led many to speculate

173
15:46.006 --> 15:49.760
that there may be more to his death than meets the eye.

174
15:50.131 --> 15:54.880
The hashtag #GreyCapitalPolitician began trending on X last night.

175
15:54.910 --> 15:58.400
People have also been digging into the former officer's past,

176
15:58.528 --> 16:02.448
including allegations of favoring politicians and shady business interests,

177
16:02.587 --> 16:06.880
as well as questionable projects such as Arokaya Land,

178
16:06.934 --> 16:08.320
a world-class luxury wellness destination.

179
16:08.787 --> 16:11.960
And following the fire alarm incident,

180
16:12.088 --> 16:15.960
suspicious evidence has emerged suggesting

181
16:15.992 --> 16:20.250
that Arokaya Land may have been operating an illegal gambling den.

182
16:20.704 --> 16:21.705
Hey! Stop filming!

183
16:23.800 --> 16:25.880
Everyone, are you seeing what I'm seeing?

184
16:30.310 --> 16:33.640
Viewers, Arokaya Land has now issued an official statement.

185
16:33.660 --> 16:36.360
Let's go straight to the live coverage.

186
16:37.520 --> 16:40.040
This is our VIP area,

187
16:40.790 --> 16:44.080
where we have particularly tight security measures

188
16:44.768 --> 16:47.800
because it's used for meetings by our top executives.

189
16:48.296 --> 16:51.160
What about the gambling chips and equipment

190
16:51.180 --> 16:53.760
found on customers leaving the premises?

191
16:54.256 --> 16:56.139
Those customers have already confessed

192
16:56.769 --> 16:58.300
that before coming here,

193
16:58.928 --> 17:00.300
they had visited a gambling den.

194
17:01.000 --> 17:02.801
We don't know which one, though.

195
17:03.011 --> 17:04.440
But it certainly wasn't here.

196
17:04.787 --> 17:08.040
We finally exposed their illegal gambling den, yet those bastards still managed to cover it all up!

197
17:08.574 --> 17:11.760
Master Tim has the deadly massage manual now. I don't know what he'll do to Dad.

198
17:14.446 --> 17:15.560
Then let's go rescue Uncle Korn.

199
17:16.264 --> 17:18.600
Let's use the evidence on Muk's phone to expose him.

200
17:19.022 --> 17:22.040
Calm down. Your hand is still injured.

201
17:22.638 --> 17:25.250
If we're going in, we need to plan carefully.

202
17:32.928 --> 17:34.130
By the way, where's Phat?

203
17:35.056 --> 17:37.174
He left last night and hasn't come back.

204
17:38.195 --> 17:39.942
Wan, call Phat.

205
17:52.286 --> 17:53.287
He's not answering.

206
17:56.720 --> 17:58.411
Phat's probably still grieving over his father.

207
17:58.582 --> 17:59.583
Give him some time.

208
18:01.643 --> 18:03.500
Let's use the evidence to bring Master Tim down.

209
18:04.160 --> 18:05.161
We don't need to wait for Phat.

210
18:14.680 --> 18:16.500
All right? Okay?

211
18:22.726 --> 18:23.727
Master Tim!

212
18:24.288 --> 18:25.806
Spread your arms! Spread your arms!

213
18:27.760 --> 18:28.761
Master Tim!

214
18:29.147 --> 18:30.700
Why did you press it on me?

215
18:31.160 --> 18:32.400
There are more videos.

216
18:32.700 --> 18:33.701
That's enough.

217
18:34.128 --> 18:35.720
Can you issue an arrest warrant for Master Tim now?

218
18:36.011 --> 18:37.012
Not yet.

219
18:37.230 --> 18:38.920
Master Tim is a well-known public figure.

220
18:39.192 --> 18:41.440
- Issuing an arrest warrant... - So you can't arrest him because he's famous?

221
18:41.827 --> 18:43.064
That's not what I meant.

222
18:43.715 --> 18:45.256
He's still making public appearances,

223
18:45.806 --> 18:47.500
and there's no indication that he's trying to flee.

224
18:47.807 --> 18:49.720
To request an arrest warrant from the court,

225
18:50.576 --> 18:53.120
we need clear evidence

226
18:53.510 --> 18:55.200
that a criminal offense has been committed.

227
18:55.371 --> 18:57.080
In fact, we should issue a summons first.

228
18:57.179 --> 18:58.380
I can testify as a witness.

229
19:00.384 --> 19:02.806
Master Tim assaulted Muk and caused her death.

230
19:03.440 --> 19:04.800
And the evidence on Muk's phone

231
19:05.067 --> 19:07.068
shows that Master Tim has killed several other people.

232
19:08.096 --> 19:09.520
What is your relationship to the deceased?

233
19:09.931 --> 19:12.790
This is a public criminal offense. Anyone can file a complaint, even if they're not related to the victim.

234
19:13.067 --> 19:14.668
But your evidence

235
19:15.547 --> 19:17.120
needs to be verified first.

236
19:17.638 --> 19:20.039
And frankly, screams alone

237
19:20.427 --> 19:22.520
don't necessarily prove that someone was being assaulted.

238
19:23.531 --> 19:24.532
What do you mean?

239
19:27.532 --> 19:31.240
The other party could claim it was something they both enjoyed.

240
19:31.836 --> 19:32.837
Hey, officer!

241
19:33.262 --> 19:36.700
- How can you say that? The evidence is right there! - Wan! Wan!

242
19:36.824 --> 19:38.502
I'm sorry. I'm sorry. Let's go.

243
19:38.592 --> 19:40.880
Thank you very much. And I'm sorry. I'm really sorry.

244
19:41.059 --> 19:42.758
Come on, let's go. It's okay.

245
19:48.310 --> 19:51.520
Today, I want to assure all of you

246
19:52.763 --> 19:55.019
that Arokaya is still going strong.

247
19:55.238 --> 19:57.000
Everything is running smoothly,

248
19:57.039 --> 19:59.654
and we've achieved all our goals.

249
20:00.700 --> 20:03.240
Because we have everyone

250
20:03.701 --> 20:06.180
especially the media, under our control.

251
20:06.766 --> 20:07.767
Therefore,

252
20:08.899 --> 20:09.900
now is the time

253
20:10.600 --> 20:13.170
to expand our business even further.

254
20:14.638 --> 20:18.480
But we no longer have Mr. Krit or Dongyang.

255
20:18.883 --> 20:20.200
That's actually a good thing.

256
20:21.267 --> 20:25.280
From now on, I'll be making all the decisions myself.

257
20:25.890 --> 20:28.300
Things will move faster than you think.

258
20:28.822 --> 20:31.480
Whatever Mr. Krit was capable of doing,

259
20:32.470 --> 20:33.480
we can do it too.

260
20:36.400 --> 20:37.901
As for the legal cases,

261
20:39.451 --> 20:40.452
don't worry.

262
20:40.946 --> 20:44.400
I can make any case go away.

263
20:49.752 --> 20:51.960
Excuse me, Master Tim. We have a serious problem!

264
20:58.078 --> 20:59.079
Dad!

265
20:59.360 --> 21:00.361
Dad!

266
21:06.038 --> 21:07.039
Dad!

267
21:18.214 --> 21:20.440
Hello, everyone. Don't be alarmed today.

268
21:20.460 --> 21:23.761
Our show's opening may look a little different than usual.

269
21:23.824 --> 21:25.760
But I assure you, today's big story

270
21:25.780 --> 21:28.246
will leave everyone absolutely stunned.

271
21:28.250 --> 21:30.440
Because our guest today

272
21:30.544 --> 21:33.120
is the person behind the video

273
21:33.328 --> 21:34.982
we just showed you.

274
21:35.500 --> 21:36.760
He's a hitman.

275
21:37.198 --> 21:38.800
And most importantly,

276
21:38.878 --> 21:42.480
he personally asked to appear on our show.

277
21:42.776 --> 21:43.880
Let's meet him now.

278
21:44.104 --> 21:45.920
- Hello. - Hello.

279
21:46.243 --> 21:48.800
Could you briefly introduce yourself to our viewers?

280
21:49.091 --> 21:50.092
Yes.

281
21:51.934 --> 21:55.187
I'm Phat Teeranasakul.

282
21:56.120 --> 21:59.080
I'm the illegitimate son of Police Colonel Krit Teeranasakul.

283
22:01.168 --> 22:04.480
And I'm a hitman wanted by the police.

284
22:05.227 --> 22:06.228
Right.

285
22:06.349 --> 22:09.080
Viewers, what I have in my hand right now

286
22:09.495 --> 22:12.320
is a DNA test report.

287
22:12.439 --> 22:15.120
The results have been officially released,

288
22:15.202 --> 22:17.320
and they confirm

289
22:17.507 --> 22:21.800
that Phat is Mr. Krit's biological son.

290
22:22.280 --> 22:23.281
Here it is.

291
22:23.576 --> 22:25.840
The DNA test results confirm their relationship.

292
22:26.896 --> 22:28.440
Now, I have to ask you this.

293
22:28.467 --> 22:30.400
The video we just showed

294
22:30.600 --> 22:32.720
is authentic,

295
22:32.930 --> 22:34.360
not AI-generated, correct?

296
22:34.852 --> 22:35.853
The video is real.

297
22:36.582 --> 22:39.000
I deliberately wore a hidden camera that day.

298
22:53.696 --> 22:58.520
I worked for my father, Mr. Krit, and Master Tim.

299
22:59.200 --> 23:02.080
My father worked with Dongyang and foreign mafia groups

300
23:03.214 --> 23:04.215
in human trafficking,

301
23:05.470 --> 23:06.471
illegal gambling,

302
23:06.627 --> 23:07.628
and money laundering.

303
23:11.528 --> 23:12.700
After Dongyang died,

304
23:13.342 --> 23:15.560
my father continued working with Master Tim.

305
23:22.603 --> 23:25.760
Uh, Phat, have you ever...

306
23:27.200 --> 23:29.320
Have you ever regretted

307
23:29.544 --> 23:32.840
being Mr. Krit's biological son?

308
23:39.336 --> 23:40.337
No.

309
23:40.846 --> 23:41.847
Never.

310
23:47.875 --> 23:49.300
What I regret...

311
23:51.960 --> 23:52.961
is...

312
23:53.224 --> 23:56.500
I regret hurting others because I followed my father's orders.

313
23:58.843 --> 24:01.720
I used to hope that if I could make my father happy one day,

314
24:04.427 --> 24:05.680
he might finally give me a hug.

315
24:08.944 --> 24:12.800
But now I realize my father never cared about anyone's feelings but his own.

316
24:15.611 --> 24:16.960
My father caused so much pain to me,

317
24:17.760 --> 24:18.761
my mother,

318
24:19.171 --> 24:21.500
and so many others who loved him.

319
24:22.627 --> 24:23.628
And I...

320
24:26.323 --> 24:27.824
I don't want to become someone like him.

321
24:33.166 --> 24:37.200
So that's why you're here today,

322
24:37.640 --> 24:39.241
to tell everyone the truth.

323
24:39.632 --> 24:40.633
That's right.

324
24:43.787 --> 24:45.883
Arokaya Land is a wellness business model

325
24:45.910 --> 24:47.800
that uses Thai soft power as a front.

326
24:49.752 --> 24:53.560
I have a list of powerful government officials involved in this operation.

327
24:55.283 --> 24:59.499
If I don't see the authorities take action to shut down Arokaya Land

328
24:59.856 --> 25:02.520
and bring Master Tim to justice,

329
25:03.702 --> 25:05.307
Your names will be all over the internet.

330
25:06.880 --> 25:09.581
Viewers, I believe things are getting just as heated out there

331
25:09.601 --> 25:12.680
as they are here in the studio.

332
25:12.814 --> 25:14.400
Let's take a short break.

333
25:14.520 --> 25:16.760
We'll be right back with more after this.

334
25:20.032 --> 25:21.456
Phat has dropped a bombshell on Master Tim.

335
25:21.510 --> 25:22.650
Arokaya is definitely going down.

336
25:24.283 --> 25:26.400
But how do we know what Phat will do next?

337
25:31.840 --> 25:32.841
Stop!

338
25:33.703 --> 25:35.740
I can handle this myself.

339
25:36.880 --> 25:38.600
That's what they always say in front of the cameras.

340
25:40.723 --> 25:41.724
Trust me.

341
25:49.683 --> 25:51.940
This government's policy is clear.

342
25:52.328 --> 25:54.600
We do not support shady businesses.

343
25:54.771 --> 25:55.880
We must crack down on all of them.

344
25:56.680 --> 25:58.081
And we must act as quickly as possible.

345
25:58.440 --> 25:59.867
I've instructed all relevant agencies

346
26:00.982 --> 26:02.700
to treat this as a national priority.

347
26:03.100 --> 26:05.840
I've already ordered an investigation into the case

348
26:06.401 --> 26:08.272
and all the processes involved.

349
26:08.806 --> 26:11.360
We must restore the reputation of our justice system

350
26:11.883 --> 26:15.960
and regain the public's trust.

351
26:16.550 --> 26:19.760
But what about the reports that you previously held shares in Arokaya?

352
26:20.494 --> 26:22.700
I invest in so many stocks every day.

353
26:22.995 --> 26:24.180
I buy and sell them all the time.

354
26:24.504 --> 26:27.240
I can barely remember what I own.

355
26:27.528 --> 26:29.448
Excuse me. I have a meeting to attend.

356
26:29.507 --> 26:31.849
- Sir! Sir! - Excuse me.

357
26:32.830 --> 26:35.880
All those videos are AI-generated. We'll let you know when Master Tim makes a statement.

358
26:37.470 --> 26:38.600
Keep them back! Keep them back!

359
26:39.272 --> 26:40.680
Go and destroy all that evidence!

360
26:41.384 --> 26:42.760
And shut down that damn show!

361
26:43.752 --> 26:45.800
I'll look into it, Master Tim. Please excuse me.

362
26:46.467 --> 26:48.771
Hey, you bastard!

363
26:49.064 --> 26:50.870
Are you abandoning me?

364
26:51.552 --> 26:52.553
You son of a bitch!

365
26:53.553 --> 26:55.600
Master Tim!

366
26:56.166 --> 26:57.330
The place is swarming with cops!

367
27:02.824 --> 27:03.825
Hurry!

368
27:05.662 --> 27:06.800
What should we do, Lieutenant?

369
27:06.920 --> 27:08.080
Inspector, go after those two!

370
27:08.328 --> 27:09.440
The rest of you, head upstairs!

371
27:12.608 --> 27:14.900
Send a helicopter to pick me up! Now!

372
27:31.899 --> 27:35.600
Your daughter and that bastard Phat have ruined everything for me!

373
27:36.800 --> 27:37.801
You

374
27:38.774 --> 27:41.080
are going to pay for what your daughter did!

375
27:41.867 --> 27:42.960
Take him up to the rooftop!

376
27:43.344 --> 27:45.500
I'll burn her father alive right in front of her!

377
27:45.851 --> 27:46.852
Go!

378
28:09.936 --> 28:10.937
Hattha!

379
28:13.144 --> 28:14.640
"Meet me on the rooftop."

380
28:15.763 --> 28:16.764
What's he doing up on the rooftop?

381
28:30.928 --> 28:31.929
Hey!

382
28:34.752 --> 28:35.800
Phat!

383
30:03.848 --> 30:04.849
Hattha!

384
30:08.590 --> 30:09.591
Stop, Master Tim!

385
30:13.523 --> 30:14.524
Uncle!

386
30:14.910 --> 30:15.911
Phat! Phat!

387
30:24.432 --> 30:26.360
Go! After him! Hurry!

388
30:36.672 --> 30:37.673
Master Tim, stop!

389
30:40.607 --> 30:42.360
Master Tim, open the door!

390
30:43.126 --> 30:44.920
No one dares help you anymore!

391
30:46.448 --> 30:49.049
Master Tim, I said open the door!

392
30:50.043 --> 30:52.400
Come out and surrender! You might get a lighter sentence!

393
30:56.443 --> 30:57.560
Master Tim, can you hear me?

394
31:02.566 --> 31:05.600
Master Tim, please come out and surrender. Trust me.

395
31:36.168 --> 31:37.840
If you don't come out, I'm breaking down the door!

396
31:38.184 --> 31:39.185
Shoot!

397
31:46.099 --> 31:48.300
I'd rather die than go to prison!

398
31:50.579 --> 31:51.580
Go in!

399
32:42.300 --> 32:43.320
Attention, all units!

400
32:43.531 --> 32:46.171
Requesting urgent backup and fire extinguishers on the rooftop. Over.

401
32:46.406 --> 32:47.407
Go!

402
33:33.958 --> 33:35.080
Have you got the fire extinguishers yet?

403
33:36.960 --> 33:39.320
Sergeant, go after them! Hurry!

404
34:04.662 --> 34:08.320
Arokaya Land has finally been ordered to shut down permanently.

405
34:08.448 --> 34:12.800
All the evidence has been sent to the DSI and several news outlets.

406
34:12.840 --> 34:14.011
As for Master Tim,

407
34:14.101 --> 34:17.480
he has now set himself on fire to escape justice.

408
34:17.502 --> 34:18.503
That's right.

409
34:21.000 --> 34:22.001
Give me a hand, son.

410
34:23.700 --> 34:25.720
- Is this right, Dad? - Yeah, that's right.

411
34:26.259 --> 34:27.260
Here.

412
34:29.293 --> 34:30.294
Okay.

413
34:33.128 --> 34:35.029
Minkheng, is this all you bought?

414
34:35.528 --> 34:38.320
Yes. We're going home soon, so I didn't buy much.

415
34:38.542 --> 34:39.800
That's not enough!

416
34:40.024 --> 34:43.800
Uncle In, are we having a Thai BBQ party to celebrate going home?

417
34:44.563 --> 34:45.564
That's right.

418
34:45.886 --> 34:48.000
And it's also a farewell party for Phat.

419
34:48.900 --> 34:49.901
A farewell party for Phat?

420
34:53.933 --> 34:55.134
I'm turning myself in tomorrow.

421
34:56.958 --> 34:58.700
Do you know what you're going to face?

422
34:59.219 --> 35:00.600
You're facing some very serious charges.

423
35:01.600 --> 35:02.601
I know.

424
35:03.201 --> 35:06.700
Murder can carry the death penalty.

425
35:08.390 --> 35:10.566
But some of the people you killed deserved to die.

426
35:11.430 --> 35:12.560
Like that bastard Master Tim.

427
35:13.431 --> 35:15.040
Come on, Hattha.

428
35:15.758 --> 35:18.547
Tim has already paid for his sins.

429
35:19.811 --> 35:21.100
Let's not speak ill of the dead.

430
35:21.352 --> 35:23.131
Death was too easy a way out for him.

431
35:23.824 --> 35:24.825
That's not very nice, sweetheart.

432
35:27.120 --> 35:28.121
And Phat,

433
35:29.872 --> 35:33.050
I admire you for owning up to your mistakes.

434
35:34.819 --> 35:36.360
I respect your decision, Phat.

435
35:40.168 --> 35:41.169
Thank you.

436
35:49.088 --> 35:50.489
Don't be a hypocrite.

437
35:51.500 --> 35:54.001
You want others to face punishment for their crimes.

438
35:59.963 --> 36:03.080
Come on, let's not get all dramatic.

439
36:04.211 --> 36:06.360
Thai BBQ can make everything better.

440
36:09.774 --> 36:12.440
Come on, let me show off my cooking skills.

441
36:12.952 --> 36:14.200
- I'll help you. - Come on.

442
36:15.406 --> 36:17.050
Then I'll go get the plates.

443
36:22.046 --> 36:23.400
I wish Muk were here with us.

444
36:29.115 --> 36:30.960
Muk will always be in our hearts.

445
36:37.075 --> 36:38.960
I don't think this is enough. I'll go buy some more.

446
36:40.900 --> 36:42.300
- Hurry back, Wan. - Okay.

447
37:21.656 --> 37:22.800
You know what,

448
37:23.320 --> 37:25.080
about Tim setting himself on fire...

449
37:25.400 --> 37:27.880
If I'd heard it from someone else, I wouldn't have believed it.

450
37:28.280 --> 37:30.160
If I hadn't seen it with my own eyes, I wouldn't have believed it either.

451
37:32.238 --> 37:35.520
- I just don't think someone like Tim would... - Come on.

452
37:37.653 --> 37:38.654
Inn.

453
37:39.664 --> 37:43.320
I think it's time we stopped talking about Tim and moved on.

454
37:43.678 --> 37:44.800
Didn't you say it yourself?

455
37:45.100 --> 37:46.201
That Thai BBQ

456
37:47.043 --> 37:48.560
can make everything better?

457
37:51.550 --> 37:52.930
Oh, the bowls!

458
37:53.443 --> 37:55.214
Minkheng! Minkheng!

459
37:55.720 --> 37:57.200
- Minkheng! - I'll go help her.

460
38:00.584 --> 38:02.320
Hey, I'll go help!

461
38:42.142 --> 38:43.143
Minkheng!

462
38:44.246 --> 38:46.440
And the most serious charge of all is murder.

463
38:46.614 --> 38:48.900
If he hadn't died to escape justice,

464
38:48.920 --> 38:51.460
he would've been looking at a very long prison sentence.

465
38:51.480 --> 38:54.020
The list of charges against him is a mile long,

466
38:54.438 --> 38:57.800
including fraud, money laundering, illegal gambling,

467
38:58.064 --> 39:00.040
and even physical assault...

468
39:16.480 --> 39:17.840
We've just received breaking news.

469
39:17.850 --> 39:20.851
Forensic experts have officially announced

470
39:20.912 --> 39:23.160
that the identification results

471
39:23.270 --> 39:26.800
of the body found burned on Arokaya Land's rooftop

472
39:27.136 --> 39:28.520
confirm that it wasn't Master Tim.

473
39:28.832 --> 39:30.160
It wasn't Master Tim!

474
39:30.310 --> 39:32.900
The body is believed to be one of his bodyguards.

475
39:33.520 --> 39:34.521
Hattha!

476
39:41.381 --> 39:42.382
Tim!

477
39:44.892 --> 39:46.100
It's me, Korn!

478
39:50.760 --> 39:52.060
The helicopter isn't coming, Master Tim!

479
39:56.563 --> 39:58.640
I'd rather die than go to prison!

480
40:34.254 --> 40:35.255
Attention, all units!

481
40:35.390 --> 40:37.960
Requesting urgent backup and fire extinguishers on the rooftop. Over.

482
40:44.220 --> 40:45.400
Have you got the fire extinguishers yet?

483
40:45.600 --> 40:47.000
Sergeant, go get them! Hurry!

484
40:59.880 --> 41:00.881
What are you going to do?

485
41:02.022 --> 41:03.923
I've come to settle the score with you bastards!

486
41:18.595 --> 41:19.596
Where are you going?

487
41:21.900 --> 41:22.901
What?

488
41:26.736 --> 41:27.737
Minkheng!

489
41:30.918 --> 41:31.919
Minkheng!

490
41:32.262 --> 41:33.263
Minkheng!

491
41:38.755 --> 41:39.756
You!

492
41:42.435 --> 41:43.436
Dad!

493
41:49.299 --> 41:50.440
Dad! Dad!

494
41:58.270 --> 41:59.271
Hey!

495
41:59.742 --> 42:02.300
Hey! Who's messing around? Open the door!

496
42:02.664 --> 42:03.665
- Open it! - Dad!

497
42:03.700 --> 42:05.960
This is not funny! Open this door right now!

498
42:06.371 --> 42:08.568
- Open it! I said open the door! - Hattha!

499
42:08.712 --> 42:09.713
Open the door right now! Open it!

500
42:10.000 --> 42:11.001
Master Tim!

501
42:15.192 --> 42:16.593
- Korn! - Master Tim!

502
42:16.610 --> 42:17.984
- Hattha! - Master Tim, please don't hurt my father! I'm begging you!

503
42:18.054 --> 42:19.054
You can hurt me instead!

504
42:19.707 --> 42:20.708
Don't worry.

505
42:21.678 --> 42:23.400
I'll make sure you all get your fair share.

506
42:25.115 --> 42:27.200
Tim, please stop.

507
42:29.059 --> 42:30.160
What you're doing

508
42:31.176 --> 42:33.128
is taking you further and further away from being a healer.

509
42:33.140 --> 42:34.250
I stopped being a healer

510
42:35.182 --> 42:38.560
the day I decided to use massage to kill people, Korn!

511
42:39.328 --> 42:40.329
You bastards

512
42:41.339 --> 42:43.140
destroyed my Arokaya!

513
42:43.979 --> 42:45.800
You destroyed Thailand's soft power!

514
42:46.640 --> 42:48.320
You robbed Thai massage of its chance to thrive!

515
42:48.500 --> 42:51.800
You're the one who used Thai massage as a front for your illegal activities!

516
42:51.880 --> 42:53.320
You're the one who tarnished its reputation!

517
42:53.571 --> 42:54.572
I told you before!

518
42:55.704 --> 42:59.214
Even manure can make a tree flourish!

519
43:01.016 --> 43:02.720
As long as Thai massage goes global,

520
43:03.096 --> 43:04.446
who gives a damn how we get there?

521
43:06.739 --> 43:08.240
It's because of backward fools like you

522
43:08.664 --> 43:10.000
that we never make any progress!

523
43:10.718 --> 43:14.456
That's why our Premium Wellness Identity never took off!

524
43:14.798 --> 43:16.400
Your logic is completely fucked up!

525
43:18.918 --> 43:20.600
You think you're faster than me, you bastard?

526
43:20.694 --> 43:23.040
Put it down! Put it down now! I dare you to try!

527
43:23.200 --> 43:24.201
Go ahead! Try me!

528
43:24.486 --> 43:25.487
Put it down!

529
43:30.502 --> 43:32.000
Dad! Dad!

530
43:33.547 --> 43:34.548
Dad!

531
43:42.054 --> 43:43.055
Just hang on a second.

532
44:38.086 --> 44:39.087
Phat!

533
44:39.536 --> 44:41.531
Hattha, hurry! Go help Phat first!

534
44:41.952 --> 44:42.953
Hurry!

535
44:51.291 --> 44:53.100
Your hands aren't what they used to be!

536
44:55.238 --> 44:57.250
They're useless now, you bitch!

537
45:11.091 --> 45:12.092
Hey!

538
45:19.227 --> 45:20.228
Wan!

539
45:24.971 --> 45:26.370
Wan! Wan!

540
46:08.203 --> 46:09.204
Phat, keep pressing!

541
46:59.931 --> 47:00.932
How are you feeling?

542
47:50.440 --> 47:52.624
In the end, everyone paid for what they did.

543
47:57.942 --> 47:58.943
It's not over yet.

544
48:01.384 --> 48:02.385
There's still one person left.

545
49:43.910 --> 49:44.911
I'll be waiting for you.

546
50:26.720 --> 50:27.721
I'm here to turn myself in.

547
50:58.363 --> 50:59.920
Phat made the right decision, sweetheart.

548
51:10.760 --> 51:11.761
[Two Months Later]

549
51:48.054 --> 51:51.520
Master Tim was prosecuted for assaulting Muk,

550
51:51.555 --> 51:53.120
resulting in her death.

551
51:53.504 --> 51:55.560
His lawyer tried to plead insanity,

552
51:55.710 --> 51:59.100
but the evidence on Muk's phone and other evidence was overwhelming.

553
52:00.120 --> 52:03.600
In the end, Master Tim was sentenced to life in prison.

554
52:04.220 --> 52:07.721
But what hurt Master Tim, once a master of traditional Thai massage,

555
52:08.648 --> 52:10.680
the most was...

556
52:17.539 --> 52:18.640
Want me to give you a massage?

557
52:19.896 --> 52:20.920
Stay the hell away from me!

558
52:31.700 --> 52:32.720
Want me to give you a massage?

559
52:33.701 --> 52:37.520
I heard you're a master of massage.

560
52:38.566 --> 52:39.680
You know who I am?

561
52:40.448 --> 52:42.600
Yeah, I can give you a massage.

562
52:43.600 --> 52:45.720
I heard you used to charge hundreds of thousands an hour.

563
52:46.262 --> 52:47.640
This time, I'm doing it for free.

564
52:48.246 --> 52:51.040
But your hands are useless. How are you gonna massage me?

565
52:51.558 --> 52:52.559
I can do it.

566
52:53.051 --> 52:54.960
- Really? - Really.

567
52:56.152 --> 52:57.153
Give it a try.

568
52:58.339 --> 52:59.960
- Just relax. - Yeah.

569
53:00.638 --> 53:02.760
Don't be scared. Take it easy.

570
53:03.320 --> 53:04.421
I'll give you a massage.

571
53:04.536 --> 53:06.555
- Go easy on me! - I'll be gentle.

572
53:10.454 --> 53:11.455
How's that?

573
53:12.374 --> 53:14.500
- Feel good? - Yeah, not bad.

574
53:14.539 --> 53:15.680
Good.

575
53:17.139 --> 53:18.140
Good.

576
53:18.275 --> 53:19.276
Feels good, huh?

577
53:26.700 --> 53:27.701
That hurts, damn it!

578
53:28.091 --> 53:29.480
Are you trying to kill me?

579
53:29.632 --> 53:31.600
How did you know? You're not supposed to know!

580
53:31.904 --> 53:34.160
You're not supposed to know I'm using the deadly massage technique!

581
53:34.331 --> 53:35.680
You're not even supposed to feel any pain!

582
53:36.187 --> 53:37.640
- Let me try again! - Stay away from me!

583
53:37.800 --> 53:39.000
Don't come any closer!

584
54:04.115 --> 54:07.160
- Wan, prepare some bone-healing medicine for me. - Yes, Dad.

585
54:07.200 --> 54:08.201
Right away.

586
54:10.635 --> 54:13.250
As for me, things turned out just as my father had warned.

587
54:13.936 --> 54:16.920
As a healer, never use your knowledge to harm others.

588
54:17.779 --> 54:20.080
In the end, I could no longer do what I loved.

589
54:23.624 --> 54:25.360
My license was revoked.

590
54:25.715 --> 54:27.880
I could no longer practice the massage therapy I loved so much.

591
54:29.048 --> 54:30.640
But even if I wanted to keep practicing massage therapy,

592
54:31.032 --> 54:32.200
I wouldn't be able to anyway.

593
54:34.592 --> 54:37.320
As for Phat, he confessed

594
54:37.422 --> 54:39.250
and cooperated with the authorities in every case.

595
54:39.747 --> 54:42.520
The court showed leniency and reduced his sentence

596
54:42.808 --> 54:44.500
from the death penalty to life imprisonment.

597
54:46.603 --> 54:50.040
Every wrongdoing comes at a price.

598
54:51.574 --> 54:52.575
Losing my chance to be a healer

599
54:53.526 --> 54:55.760
was the price I paid for seeking revenge.

600
54:57.142 --> 54:58.240
If imprisonment

601
54:58.762 --> 55:01.160
was the price he had to pay for taking lives,

602
55:02.827 --> 55:04.128
then having to wait for him

603
55:04.944 --> 55:07.360
was another price I had to pay.

604
55:29.478 --> 55:30.479
Hey, you.

605
55:38.400 --> 55:39.401
How was your day?

606
55:41.731 --> 55:42.732
Better.

607
55:44.392 --> 55:46.440
My lower back hurts a little, though.

608
55:46.974 --> 55:47.975
Your lower back hurts?

609
55:50.771 --> 55:53.700
I wish I could give you a massage.

610
55:58.526 --> 56:00.280
Want to try a few simple stretches on your own?

611
56:01.926 --> 56:05.080
Sit like this and put your legs together.

612
56:05.880 --> 56:06.881
- Like this? - Mm-hmm.

613
56:07.360 --> 56:08.520
Then place your hands on your knees.

614
56:11.638 --> 56:12.800
Slide them down your legs.

615
56:15.013 --> 56:16.600
- Like this? - Mm-hmm. Bend forward.

616
56:16.700 --> 56:17.701
Like this.

617
56:19.038 --> 56:20.960
Or you can try another stretch. Sit up straight again.

618
56:21.144 --> 56:22.480
Spread your legs a little.

619
56:23.278 --> 56:24.360
Then bend forward

620
56:25.054 --> 56:27.520
like before, and twist your body to the left.

621
56:28.427 --> 56:30.160
- Like this? - Yeah, to the left.

622
56:30.502 --> 56:31.503
Bend down a little further.

623
56:31.579 --> 56:32.640
- Like this? - Yeah.

624
56:33.179 --> 56:35.334
- And if your shoulders hurt... - Your shoulders hurt too?

625
56:35.995 --> 56:37.700
You can position your hand like this.

626
56:39.243 --> 56:41.000
Then press down on your shoulder.

627
56:45.243 --> 56:47.100
What if my hand hurts? What should I do?

628
56:47.267 --> 56:49.600
Use your thumb to press right here.

629
56:50.606 --> 56:52.000
- Like this? - Yes.

630
56:52.286 --> 56:54.200
Press down, then slide it down to here.

631
56:59.208 --> 57:00.680
If pressing here makes the pain go away,

632
57:00.968 --> 57:03.240
where should I press to make the longing go away?

633
57:09.424 --> 57:10.480
Look at you, making jokes now.

634
57:13.478 --> 57:14.479
I've been thinking about that one all day.

635
57:14.609 --> 57:15.610
All day?

636
57:26.672 --> 57:27.880
But I really do miss you.

637
57:29.419 --> 57:30.420
I miss you too.

638
57:59.640 --> 58:01.641
[The End]
